{"attribution":[{"note":"NFL research data; individual upstream obligations remain documented in the repository.","source":"nflverse","url":"https://nflverse.nflverse.com/"},{"note":"NBA research source; underlying ESPN/NBA public-display and commercial rights remain unresolved.","source":"SportsDataverse / ESPN","url":"https://github.com/sportsdataverse/sportsdataverse-data"},{"note":"NHL research data; attribution and non-commercial conditions apply.","source":"MoneyPuck","url":"https://moneypuck.com/data.htm"},{"note":"Premier League research source; underlying FPL data rights remain upstream and commercial use is unresolved.","source":"Vaastav Fantasy Premier League archive","url":"https://github.com/vaastav/Fantasy-Premier-League"},{"note":"CC0 profile enrichment used only where strict identity matching succeeded.","source":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Wikidata:Licensing"}],"claims":{"athlete_disjoint_diagnostic":"A separate pre-freeze player-group diagnostic measures generalization to unseen identities. It is non-temporal and does not replace or change the frozen-season evidence gate.","bridge":"exploratory analogy; not a sport-switch probability or validated outcome forecast","bridge_target_proxy_reconstruction_gate":"Compatibility name for a forward target-role test: prior build plus shared canonical dimensions must improve on build alone; it is not cross-sport validation.","native_forecast":"next-season estimate from prior information","native_profile":"next-season benchmark using only build and canonical cross-sport dimensions; promotion requires incremental evidence over build alone","observed":"descriptive role-season percentile","partial_pooling":"Native build-plus-profile heads may borrow from predeclared related-role families. Shrinkage is tuned only in pre-2025 rolling folds and deployed only when the frozen athlete-clustered 90% MAE-advantage interval over role-only has a positive lower bound with at least 20 eligible athletes.","percentile_validation":"Frozen predictions receive fixed-bin percentile calibration and threshold plus cohort-ranked top-decile diagnostics; these are reported, not used to tune gates.","physical":"performance association from build; not causal","prediction_uncertainty":"Nominal 90% prediction ranges use rolling-origin absolute residuals with one latest residual per athlete and a finite-sample conformal order statistic. Frozen empirical coverage is reported and cross-sport distribution shift can invalidate nominal coverage.","team_context":"Completed-season role opportunity share and leave-one-player-out teammate strength are tested only as next-season native-forecast candidates. The base role/history model remains deployed unless the candidate beats the base model, the best history baseline, and neutral on the frozen cohort with at least 20 eligible athletes having both context fields. Team identity and future-season context are never model inputs, and context never enters cross-sport bridges.","training_cohort":"Eligible and positive-opportunity low-sample labels may train with empirical opportunity/coverage weights. Frozen evaluation remains eligible-only, and rows must satisfy the deployed build and fixed-dimension requirements."},"feature_labels":{"age":"age","availability_percentile":"availability","bmi":"height-to-weight balance","dimension_creation_distribution_percentile":"creation and distribution","dimension_defensive_disruption_percentile":"defensive disruption","dimension_discipline_efficiency_percentile":"discipline and efficiency","dimension_possession_security_percentile":"possession security","dimension_progression_territory_percentile":"progression and territory gain","dimension_recovery_rebounding_percentile":"recovery and rebounding","dimension_scoring_finishing_percentile":"scoring and finishing","height_cm":"height","observed_role_percentile":"observed home-role result","sustained_3y_percentile":"sustained three-season performance","weight_kg":"weight"},"limitations":["Observed scores are retrospective role-season percentiles, not model predictions.","Native forecasts use prior information and may be withheld or trail a history baseline.","Physical-only estimates are associations with build, not causal effects or talent grades.","Cross-sport transfer results are exploratory analogies, never probabilities of switching successfully.","A bridge gate tests whether a prior target-role profile improves the target role's next-season prediction over build alone; it is not evidence that performance transfers between sports.","Low-sample native scores remain descriptive and may train at reduced reliability weight, but eligible seasons alone determine frozen evaluation; cross-sport performance transfer remains withheld.","A percentile is relative to one target role and cohort; equal numbers in different roles do not imply equal sporting value.","Undated profile measurements and public-stat proxies limit historical and tactical interpretation."],"model":{"bridge_version":"lagged-ordered-pair-dimension-intersection-v3","evidence":{"bridge_models_fit":286,"bridge_target_proxy_heads_passing_gate":132,"bridge_target_role_forward_profile_heads_passing_gate":132,"native_models_beating_history":2,"native_models_deployment_supported":0,"native_models_fit":23,"native_profile_models_fit":23,"native_profile_models_supported_over_build":11,"physical_models_beating_neutral":13,"physical_models_fit":23,"physical_models_supported":4},"frozen_test_season":2025,"role_taxonomy_version":"all-roles-broad-v2","schema_version":"2.2.0","sha256":"5ef3054a299e661628ae44077c08ced3d57ee48d6138d98e243bfa42873ca5a0","target_version":"role-season-reliability-weighted-percentiles-v2"},"release_boundary":"Compact derived model outputs only. Raw data, processed rows, saved estimators, provider assets, and league or team marks are not included.","role_validation":{"epl:DEF":{"build_profile":{"baseline_error":23.008267939614544,"baseline_improvement_p